== Trivia ==
* Conquest was added in the ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* He is an alternative of {{e|Death}}.
** Despite being Death's alternate version, his attacks are direct variations of {{e|War}}'s first phase.
*** His ID and room ID also both show that he is a variation of War. 
*** In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', this similarity with War went comically further due to [https://bindingofisaac.fandom.com/wiki/Conquest#Bugs a bug where Conquest could in-fact replace War as the Chapter 3 Harbinger fight].  
* Conquest is one of the actual [[wikipedia:Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse|Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse]], as opposed to {{e|Pestilence}}.
* The stitching on Conquest's stomach is an autopsy stitch, an incision in the shape of a Y.
* {{dlc+|a+}} Conquest can be found in {{s|The Void}}, even before being unlocked.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|a+}} Delirium's Conquest form's horse resembles {{e|Famine}}'s horse rather than Conquest's.
* Conquest is the only alternate boss in both the original ''The Binding of Isaac'' and ''Rebirth'' that is not a reference to one of [[Edmund McMillen|Edmund McMillen's]] previous games.

